                                <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-1">Real-Time Dashboard</h4>
                                <p class="text-xs font-normal text-[#8A8A93] leading-relaxed">Monitor all your cron jobs, heartbeats, and scheduled tasks from a unified interface with live status updates.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-image absolute inset-0" data-content="1">
                            <div class="p-8 flex flex-col justify-center min-h-[300px]">
                                <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-2">Intelligent Alerting</h4>
                                <p class="text-xs font-normal text-[#8A8A93] leading-relaxed mb-4">Get notified via Slack, Email, PagerDuty, Telegram, or custom webhooks the moment something goes wrong.</p>
                                <div class="space-y-2">
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#22C55E]"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#22C55E]"></span>Email alerts delivered</div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#22C55E]"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#22C55E]"></span>Telegram bot notified</div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#22C55E]"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#22C55E]"></span>Slack channel posted</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-image absolute inset-0" data-content="2">
                            <img src="/images/logs.png" alt="Execution Logs" class="w-full rounded-t-xl">
                            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-5 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#111114] to-transparent">
                                <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-1">Complete Audit Trail</h4>
                                <p class="text-xs font-normal text-[#8A8A93] leading-relaxed">Detailed execution logs, error traces, and performance metrics for every job run.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-image absolute inset-0" data-content="3">
                            <img src="/images/status.png" alt="Status Page" class="w-full rounded-t-xl">
                            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-5 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#111114] to-transparent">
                                <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-1">Public Status Pages</h4>
                                <p class="text-xs font-normal text-[#8A8A93] leading-relaxed">Share real-time status updates with your team through customizable public and internal status pages.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

